{"lines": [{"start": 3, "end": 119, "text": "Stop asking \"are you sure?\" You only get its answer twice.", "words": [{"w": "Stop", "s": 6, "e": 15}, {"w": "asking", "s": 15, "e": 28}, {"w": "\"are", "s": 36, "e": 40}, {"w": "you", "s": 40, "e": 44}, {"w": "sure?\"", "s": 44, "e": 54}, {"w": "You", "s": 70, "e": 73}, {"w": "only", "s": 73, "e": 80}, {"w": "get", "s": 80, "e": 86}, {"w": "its", "s": 86, "e": 90}, {"w": "answer", "s": 90, "e": 99}, {"w": "twice.", "s": 99, "e": 110}]}, {"start": 128, "end": 232, "text": "The real check is habit five. Four come first.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 131, "e": 136}, {"w": "real", "s": 136, "e": 144}, {"w": "check", "s": 144, "e": 155}, {"w": "is", "s": 155, "e": 165}, {"w": "habit", "s": 165, "e": 172}, {"w": "five.", "s": 172, "e": 186}, {"w": "Four", "s": 201, "e": 204}, {"w": "come", "s": 204, "e": 213}, {"w": "first.", "s": 213, "e": 225}]}, {"start": 244, "end": 302, "text": "One. Narrow the question.", "words": [{"w": "One.", "s": 247, "e": 257}, {"w": "Narrow", "s": 268, "e": 278}, {"w": "the", "s": 278, "e": 284}, {"w": "question.", "s": 284, "e": 295}]}, {"start": 308, "end": 413, "text": "\"Give me a business idea\" gets an idea that fits anyone.", "words": [{"w": "\"Give", "s": 311, "e": 318}, {"w": "me", "s": 318, "e": 323}, {"w": "a", "s": 323, "e": 327}, {"w": "business", "s": 327, "e": 334}, {"w": "idea\"", "s": 334, "e": 350}, {"w": "gets", "s": 359, "e": 365}, {"w": "an", "s": 365, "e": 369}, {"w": "idea", "s": 369, "e": 377}, {"w": "that", "s": 377, "e": 386}, {"w": "fits", "s": 386, "e": 392}, {"w": "anyone.", "s": 392, "e": 405}]}, {"start": 422, "end": 540, "text": "Ask for a shortlist. Add your limits, like ten hours a week.", "words": [{"w": "Ask", "s": 425, "e": 433}, {"w": "for", "s": 433, "e": 440}, {"w": "a", "s": 440, "e": 444}, {"w": "shortlist.", "s": 444, "e": 460}, {"w": "Add", "s": 469, "e": 475}, {"w": "your", "s": 475, "e": 480}, {"w": "limits,", "s": 480, "e": 490}, {"w": "like", "s": 498, "e": 505}, {"w": "ten", "s": 505, "e": 512}, {"w": "hours", "s": 519, "e": 525}, {"w": "a", "s": 525, "e": 530}, {"w": "week.", "s": 530, "e": 535}]}, {"start": 546, "end": 611, "text": "Then ask which one to start with.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 549, "e": 560}, {"w": "ask", "s": 572, "e": 575}, {"w": "which", "s": 575, "e": 582}, {"w": "one", "s": 582, "e": 589}, {"w": "to", "s": 589, "e": 594}, {"w": "start", "s": 594, "e": 601}, {"w": "with.", "s": 601, "e": 608}]}, {"start": 623, "end": 690, "text": "Two. One action per step.", "words": [{"w": "Two.", "s": 626, "e": 635}, {"w": "One", "s": 652, "e": 654}, {"w": "action", "s": 654, "e": 666}, {"w": "per", "s": 666, "e": 675}, {"w": "step.", "s": 675, "e": 684}]}, {"start": 697, "end": 794, "text": "Give it two jobs in one step, and it guesses at one.", "words": [{"w": "Give", "s": 700, "e": 707}, {"w": "it", "s": 707, "e": 711}, {"w": "two", "s": 711, "e": 718}, {"w": "jobs", "s": 718, "e": 728}, {"w": "in", "s": 728, "e": 733}, {"w": "one", "s": 733, "e": 740}, {"w": "step,", "s": 740, "e": 751}, {"w": "and", "s": 759, "e": 763}, {"w": "it", "s": 763, "e": 766}, {"w": "guesses", "s": 766, "e": 775}, {"w": "at", "s": 775, "e": 783}, {"w": "one.", "s": 783, "e": 790}]}, {"start": 799, "end": 831, "text": "So split it.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 802, "e": 810}, {"w": "split", "s": 815, "e": 823}, {"w": "it.", "s": 823, "e": 828}]}, {"start": 843, "end": 954, "text": "Three. Pick the tool for the job, not the tab that's open.", "words": [{"w": "Three.", "s": 846, "e": 857}, {"w": "Pick", "s": 868, "e": 872}, {"w": "the", "s": 872, "e": 878}, {"w": "tool", "s": 878, "e": 884}, {"w": "for", "s": 884, "e": 890}, {"w": "the", "s": 890, "e": 895}, {"w": "job,", "s": 895, "e": 904}, {"w": "not", "s": 916, "e": 922}, {"w": "the", "s": 922, "e": 928}, {"w": "tab", "s": 928, "e": 935}, {"w": "that's", "s": 935, "e": 943}, {"w": "open.", "s": 943, "e": 951}]}, {"start": 966, "end": 1087, "text": "Four. Chain them. One tool does the work, another checks it.", "words": [{"w": "Four.", "s": 969, "e": 980}, {"w": "Chain", "s": 994, "e": 998}, {"w": "them.", "s": 998, "e": 1005}, {"w": "One", "s": 1021, "e": 1023}, {"w": "tool", "s": 1023, "e": 1029}, {"w": "does", "s": 1029, "e": 1036}, {"w": "the", "s": 1036, "e": 1041}, {"w": "work,", "s": 1041, "e": 1050}, {"w": "another", "s": 1058, "e": 1066}, {"w": "checks", "s": 1066, "e": 1077}, {"w": "it.", "s": 1077, "e": 1086}]}, {"start": 1099, "end": 1177, "text": "Five. Back to \"are you sure?\"", "words": [{"w": "Five.", "s": 1102, "e": 1115}, {"w": "Back", "s": 1129, "e": 1131}, {"w": "to", "s": 1131, "e": 1157}, {"w": "\"are", "s": 1157, "e": 1157}, {"w": "you", "s": 1157, "e": 1162}, {"w": "sure?\"", "s": 1162, "e": 1170}]}, {"start": 1183, "end": 1277, "text": "Ask Claude or Gemini the exact same question.", "words": [{"w": "Ask", "s": 1186, "e": 1197}, {"w": "Claude", "s": 1197, "e": 1209}, {"w": "or", "s": 1209, "e": 1217}, {"w": "Gemini", "s": 1217, "e": 1228}, {"w": "the", "s": 1228, "e": 1239}, {"w": "exact", "s": 1239, "e": 1250}, {"w": "same", "s": 1250, "e": 1260}, {"w": "question.", "s": 1260, "e": 1272}]}, {"start": 1285, "end": 1359, "text": "Then check it against a named source.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 1288, "e": 1298}, {"w": "check", "s": 1302, "e": 1310}, {"w": "it", "s": 1310, "e": 1315}, {"w": "against", "s": 1315, "e": 1322}, {"w": "a", "s": 1322, "e": 1330}, {"w": "named", "s": 1330, "e": 1339}, {"w": "source.", "s": 1339, "e": 1350}]}, {"start": 1364, "end": 1426, "text": "Sounding sure doesn't count.", "words": [{"w": "Sounding", "s": 1367, "e": 1382}, {"w": "sure", "s": 1382, "e": 1393}, {"w": "doesn't", "s": 1393, "e": 1413}, {"w": "count.", "s": 1413, "e": 1419}]}, {"start": 1438, "end": 1538, "text": "All five, with examples, are in The Exact Method.", "words": [{"w": "All", "s": 1441, "e": 1449}, {"w": "five,", "s": 1449, "e": 1461}, {"w": "with", "s": 1461, "e": 1473}, {"w": "examples,", "s": 1473, "e": 1488}, {"w": "are", "s": 1488, "e": 1501}, {"w": "in", "s": 1501, "e": 1507}, {"w": "The", "s": 1507, "e": 1510}, {"w": "Exact", "s": 1510, "e": 1521}, {"w": "Method.", "s": 1521, "e": 1533}]}, {"start": 1545, "end": 1630, "text": "Comment METHOD, and I'll send you habit one free.", "words": [{"w": "Comment", "s": 1548, "e": 1558}, {"w": "METHOD,", "s": 1558, "e": 1570}, {"w": "and", "s": 1580, "e": 1583}, {"w": "I'll", "s": 1583, "e": 1588}, {"w": "send", "s": 1588, "e": 1593}, {"w": "you", "s": 1593, "e": 1598}, {"w": "habit", "s": 1598, "e": 1605}, {"w": "one", "s": 1605, "e": 1614}, {"w": "free.", "s": 1614, "e": 1625}]}, {"start": 1642, "end": 1730, "text": "Because \"are you sure?\" was never a check.", "words": [{"w": "Because", "s": 1645, "e": 1657}, {"w": "\"are", "s": 1665, "e": 1671}, {"w": "you", "s": 1671, "e": 1675}, {"w": "sure?\"", "s": 1675, "e": 1686}, {"w": "was", "s": 1697, "e": 1701}, {"w": "never", "s": 1701, "e": 1711}, {"w": "a", "s": 1711, "e": 1718}, {"w": "check.", "s": 1718, "e": 1724}]}], "end": 1730, "total": 1760}